00:31:14.249 --> 00:31:16.627 size:30% position:35%,middle line:90%
de dipirona.

00:31:16.710 --> 00:31:19.546 size:73% position:14%,middle line:90%
Coisa ruim é
o gosto de orelha. Ave Maria!

